    LMS["🏫 LMS (Canvas/Moodle)"]:::ext

    %% Flows
    LMS --> LTI
    LTI --> I1
    LTI --> Orchestrator
    LTI --> Feedback
    Feedback --> LTI
    LTI --> LMS

    Orchestrator -- simulation.completed --> RQ
    RQ --> Feedback
    Feedback -- feedback.ready --> RQ
    RQ --> Analytics
    Analytics --> LTI
    Analytics --> G

